    "body": "## Problem\n\nWhen the 'statuscolumn' width changes mid-redraw, `win_update()` starts over from the top line but keeps the 'hlsearch' and match state from the first pass. That state already points at a later line, so `next_search_hl()` skips the lines above it and they lose their search highlight until the next full redraw.\n\n## Solution\n\nCall `init_search_hl()` when restarting from the top, next to the existing decor state reset.\n\nFixes #41592\n",
    "closed_at": null,
